OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes' in class
OL,6,
OL,7,FGriffin was shot dead by a father whose
OL,8,Ftwo daughters attend the school.
OL,10,FUS President Donald Trump praised
OL,11,FKaylub Giamanco as a "great hero"
OL,13,FSchools in the district will remain
OL,14,Fclosed today "due to the tragedy",
OL,15,Fofficials say, as the community grieves
OL,16,Fthose it lost
OL,18,FBBC Verify looks at how common shooting
OL,19,Fincidents at US schools have become
OL,20,Fover the last 15 years
